      {
        "id": 17163,
        "title": "Operador de igualdad",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145228,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aprendimos cómo crear y almacenar valores, pero ¿cómo los comparamos?</p><p>En los juegos, comparamos números en situaciones como verificar si la puntuación del jugador coincide con la puntuación necesaria para desbloquear el siguiente nivel.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerScore = \" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scoreToUnlock = \" /><text value=\"1500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145229,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para comparar si dos números son iguales, usamos el <strong>operador de igualdad</strong>, <code>===</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"2\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"5 === 5\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>=</code> seguido de <code>=</code> y finalmente <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145230,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Al comparar, solo hay dos resultados: <code>true</code> o <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145231,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cuando comparamos los mismos números con el operador de igualdad, el resultado es <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>3</code> seguido de <code>===</code> y finalmente <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145232,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cuando comparamos dos números diferentes con el operador de igualdad, el resultado es <code>false</code>.</p><p>Elige la opción que compara <code>9</code> con <code>10</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"9 = 10\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>9 === 10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145233,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué usamos para verificar si dos números son iguales?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>===</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145234,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué muestra este código en la consola?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\"><code>false</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145235,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿En cuál de estas situaciones necesitaríamos verificar si dos números son iguales?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Cuando verificas si la salud de un jugador es <em>exactamente</em> 0 (fin del juego)</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Al verificar si la salud de un jugador es <em>menor o igual a</em> 20 (advertencia de salud baja)</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Cuando verificas si la salud de un jugador es <em>exactamente</em> 0 (fin del juego).</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145236,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué muestra este código en la consola?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>18</code> y luego <code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>18</code> y luego <code>513</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>18</code> y luego <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145237,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Comprueba si el valor de <code>coins</code> es igual a <code>11</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"42\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coins = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(coins === \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>=</code> seguido de <code>=</code> y luego <code>=</code>, <code>11</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145238,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Agrega el operador de comparación de igualdad.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145239,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Muestra <code>false</code> en la consola.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>13</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145240,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Comprueba si estos números son iguales escribiendo <code>===</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"19\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17164,
        "title": "Operador de desigualdad",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145241,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para verificar si un valor en un juego no es igual a otro valor, usamos el <strong>operador de desigualdad</strong>, <code>!==</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145242,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos almacenar el resultado de una comparación con el operador de desigualdad en una variable.</p><p>Guarda la comparación entre <code>playerLives</code> y <code>maxLives</code> en la variable <code>result</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerLives = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" maxLives = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = playerLives !== maxLives;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>=</code> seguido de <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145243,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Las variables también pueden almacenar el resultado de comparaciones de igualdad.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"78\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentState = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pausedState = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = currentState === pausedState;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>=</code> seguido de <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145244,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos comparar valores con variables y variables con otras variables.</p><p>Escribe <code>===</code> para comparar el contenido de las variables.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"73\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerScore = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" targetScore = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerScore === targetScore);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerScore !== targetScore);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145245,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué valor debería tener <code>playerHealth</code> para que la comparación en la variable <code>isFullHealth</code> dé <code>false</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = ? ;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isFullHealth = playerHealth === \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>78</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>100</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>78</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145246,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué muestra este código en la consola?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>false</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145247,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué valor deberíamos darle a la variable <code>coins</code> para almacenar <code>true</code> en <code>hasMaxCoins</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coins = ? ; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hasMaxCoins = coins === \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1000</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>67</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>1000</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145248,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuál debería ser el valor de <code>playerScore</code> si queremos que <code>equal</code> sea <code>true</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerScore = ? ;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highScore = \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" equal = playerScore === highScore;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>80</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>80</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145249,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Agrega el operador que hace que la comparación sea <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145250,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Comprueba si el <code>ammo</code> del jugador es igual a <code>13</code> y almacena el resultado en la variable <code>correctAmmo</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"correctAnswer\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ammo = \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" correctAmmo = ammo === \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(correctAmmo);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>=</code> seguido de <code>===</code> y finalmente <code>13</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145251,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Comprueba si el <code>level</code> actual del jugador es igual a <code>bossLevel</code> escribiendo <code>===</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"60\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bossLevel = \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(level === bossLevel);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145252,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verifica si el nombre del jugador no está vacío escribiendo <code>!==</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"55\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" nameLength = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" validName = nameLength !== \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
